{"page":612,"width":1626,"height":2159,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"그저 함수를 반환하는 것만으로 백트래킹이 이루어집니다. 상위 부분해를 시도 중인 함수로 제어 호","words":[{"text":"그저","x":160,"y":200,"width":55,"height":30},{"text":"함수를","x":228,"y":199,"width":84,"height":30},{"text":"반환하는","x":323,"y":199,"width":110,"height":30},{"text":"것만으로","x":444,"y":199,"width":107,"height":30},{"text":"백트래킹이","x":562,"y":200,"width":129,"height":30},{"text":"이루어집니다.","x":705,"y":199,"width":162,"height":31},{"text":"상위","x":880,"y":198,"width":52,"height":31},{"text":"부분해를","x":944,"y":197,"width":108,"height":30},{"text":"시도","x":1062,"y":196,"width":55,"height":29},{"text":"중인","x":1126,"y":195,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"함수로","x":1192,"y":195,"width":82,"height":29},{"text":"제어","x":1285,"y":195,"width":52,"height":29},{"text":"호","x":1350,"y":196,"width":29,"height":24}]},{"text":"름이 돌아가기 때문입니다. 제어를 돌려받은 상위 부분해는 나머지 -부뿐 후보해들을 차례대로 시도하","words":[{"text":"름이","x":160,"y":258,"width":55,"height":29},{"text":"돌아가기","x":225,"y":256,"width":107,"height":32},{"text":"때문입니다.","x":344,"y":256,"width":137,"height":30},{"text":"제어를","x":493,"y":257,"width":79,"height":30},{"text":"돌려받은","x":579,"y":257,"width":105,"height":30},{"text":"상위","x":690,"y":257,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"부분해는","x":751,"y":256,"width":107,"height":30},{"text":"나머지","x":867,"y":255,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"-부뿐","x":957,"y":255,"width":56,"height":29},{"text":"후보해들을","x":1021,"y":253,"width":141,"height":30},{"text":"차례대로","x":1171,"y":253,"width":112,"height":29},{"text":"시도하","x":1294,"y":252,"width":87,"height":30}]},{"text":"고, 모든 부분 후보해에 대해 시도를 마치면 여기서도 함수를 반환하여 자신을 호출한 더 상위의 부","words":[{"text":"고,","x":160,"y":319,"width":36,"height":27},{"text":"모든","x":209,"y":316,"width":58,"height":28},{"text":"부분","x":275,"y":315,"width":57,"height":29},{"text":"후보해에","x":340,"y":313,"width":108,"height":30},{"text":"대해","x":460,"y":314,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"시도를","x":523,"y":314,"width":79,"height":29},{"text":"마치면